{"status":"REVIEW","clause_id":"PAY-d26389456e3247997cb6","clause_number":"1.6.3","title":"1.6.3.Tolterodine L-tartrate  (如Detrusitol) ; solifenacin succinate  (如Vesicare)；mirabegron (如Betmiga):(90/7/1、93/10/1、96/4/1、104/2/1)","source":{"key":"pay","label":"給付規定","status":"REVIEW","error":null,"indexed_nodes":6807,"tables":155,"source_name":"最新版藥品給付規定內容(整份帶走)-115.10.22更新","version":"2026-10-22","announcement_date":null,"page_updated_date":"2026-10-27","effective_date":null,"date_status":"待人工核實，未確認現行有效","verification_status":"REVIEW","pdf_url":"/documents/pay.pdf","pdf_sha256":"5bdd0292a73271c98f7f39afca6971b2bd8fbd4c78a697cd37f43ab78cd1414b"},"pdf_page_start":20,"pdf_page_end":20,"scope":"原始節點及既有子項；非人工驗證完整條文","verification_status":"REVIEW","human_verified":false,"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p000566","raw_text":"1.6.3.Tolterodine L-tartrate  (如Detrusitol) ; solifenacin succinate  (如Vesicare)；mirabegron (如Betmiga):(90/7/1、93/10/1、96/4/1、104/2/1)","display_text":"1.6.3.Tolterodine L-tartrate  (如Detrusitol) ; solifenacin succinate  (如Vesicare)；mirabegron (如Betmiga):(90/7/1、93/10/1、96/4/1、104/2/1)","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[566]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p000567","raw_text":"1.限符合下列診斷標準條件之一者：","display_text":"1.限符合下列診斷標準條件之一者：","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[567]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p000568","raw_text":"(1)頻尿：每天（24小時）排尿次數超過八次，並有詳實病歷紀錄。","display_text":"(1)頻尿：每天（24小時）排尿次數超過八次，並有詳實病歷紀錄。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[568]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p000569","raw_text":"(2)急尿：病患自述經常有一種很突然、很強烈想解尿的感覺。","display_text":"(2)急尿：病患自述經常有一種很突然、很強烈想解尿的感覺。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[569]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p000570","raw_text":"(3)急迫性尿失禁：對於尿急的感覺無法控制，並於24小時內至少也有一次漏尿之情形。","display_text":"(3)急迫性尿失禁：對於尿急的感覺無法控制，並於24小時內至少也有一次漏尿之情形。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[570]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p000571","raw_text":"2.不宜使用本類藥品者：","display_text":"2.不宜使用本類藥品者：","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[571]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p000572","raw_text":"(1)小兒夜尿。","display_text":"(1)小兒夜尿。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[572]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p000573","raw_text":"(2)單純性應力性尿失禁。","display_text":"(2)單純性應力性尿失禁。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[573]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p000574","raw_text":"(3)膀胱逼尿肌無反射（detrusor areflexia）或膀胱不收縮所引起之排尿困難或尿失禁之症狀。","display_text":"(3)膀胱逼尿肌無反射（detrusor areflexia）或膀胱不收縮所引起之排尿困難或尿失禁之症狀。","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[574]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p000575","raw_text":"3.Solifenacin succinate（如Vesicare）及mirabegron (如Betmiga)藥品每天限使用1錠。(104/2/1)","display_text":"3.Solifenacin succinate（如Vesicare）及mirabegron (如Betmiga)藥品每天限使用1錠。(104/2/1)","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[575]"}],"ancestors":[{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p000066","raw_text":"第1節 神經系統藥物 Drugs acting on the nervous system","display_text":"第1節 神經系統藥物 Drugs acting on the nervous system","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[66]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p000472","raw_text":"1.6.其他  Miscellaneous","display_text":"1.6.其他  Miscellaneous","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[472]"}],"nested_tables":{},"references":[],"missing_source_paragraphs":[],"original_nodes":[{"clause_id":"PAY-d26389456e3247997cb6","clause_number":"1.6.3","parent_clause_id":"PAY-80120e1bd3de365ba1ef","original_text":"1.6.3.Tolterodine L-tartrate  (如Detrusitol) ; solifenacin succinate  (如Vesicare)；mirabegron (如Betmiga):(90/7/1、93/10/1、96/4/1、104/2/1)","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p000566"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-e2511ce9b58b76ebfb07","clause_number":"1.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-d26389456e3247997cb6","origina